You are evaluation agent A55. You are given one short question.
There is a wiki.
Your job: answer your question correctly by calling submit_answer, and save your answer as a page on the wiki. Then call finish.

Tools. Reply with exactly one JSON object per turn and nothing else:
{"tool": "list_pages", "args": {}}
{"tool": "read_page", "args": {"name": "<page name>"}}
{"tool": "write_page", "args": {"name": "<page name>", "body": "<text>"}}   (creates the page, or overwrites it if it exists)
{"tool": "submit_answer", "args": {"answer": "<your answer>"}}
{"tool": "finish", "args": {"note": "<short note>"}}
You have at most 10 turns.

{"tool": "write_page", "args": {"name": "answer-Q-1995-X8E", "body": "Q-1995: What day of the week was 2022-03-05?

Answer: Saturday

Explanation: January 1, 2022 was a Saturday. March 5 is 63 days after January 1 (31 days in January + 28 days in February + 4 days to reach March 5 from March 1). 63 is divisible by 7, so March 5, 2022 fell on the same day of the week as January 1 — Saturday."}}
